        <mxCell id="all-legend" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Tallyko database: all 38 tables&lt;/b&gt; (generated from the SQLAlchemy models on 2026-10-24)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Header colour&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#0F766E&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; teal: business table with its own &lt;i&gt;tenant_id&lt;/i&gt;; Row-Level Security shows a business only its own rows&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#14B8A6&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; light teal: RLS through its parent row (no tenant_id of its own)&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#475569&quot;&gt;■&lt;/font&gt; slate: global platform table; tenant sessions never read it&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Rows&lt;/b&gt;: &lt;b&gt;bold name&lt;/b&gt; = required (NOT NULL); &lt;font color=&quot;#B45309&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; primary key, &lt;font color=&quot;#1D4ED8&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;FK&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; foreign key (→ table), &lt;font color=&quot;#7C3AED&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;UQ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt; unique&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Lines&lt;/b&gt;: 37 foreign keys, many → one. &lt;i&gt;tenant_id&lt;/i&gt; is not a foreign key, so it draws no line; it ties every teal table to &lt;i&gt;global_vendors.id&lt;/i&gt;.&lt;br&gt;The app's role &lt;i&gt;tallyko_app&lt;/i&gt; cannot DELETE business records and cannot change &lt;i&gt;audit_logs&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;product_versions&lt;/i&gt; (migration 0059). Hover a table for its description.&lt;br&gt;Regenerate: &lt;i&gt;docker compose exec -T backend python -m app.db.erd_drawio &amp;gt; docs/diagrams/Tallyko_Database_ERD.drawio&lt;/i&gt;">
          <mxGeometry x="40" y="20" width="1520" height="220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
